stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_parse: parse request(start_slot, count, columns)
    q_parse --> q_compute_range: data_column_serve_range = [max(current_epoch - MIN_EPOCHS, FULU_FORK_EPOCH), current_epoch]
    q_compute_range --> q_check_range: requested range in serve_range
    q_check_range --> q_error: range outside serve_range / ResourceUnavailable
    q_check_range --> q_iter_slots: range within serve_range
    q_iter_slots --> q_check_slot: for slot in [start_slot, start_slot + count)
    q_check_slot --> q_iter_slots: slot has no known data columns / skip
    q_check_slot --> q_iter_columns: slot has data columns
    q_iter_columns --> q_verify_sidecar: for column_index in requested columns
    q_verify_sidecar --> q_verify_inclusion: verify_data_column_sidecar(sidecar)
    q_verify_inclusion --> q_verify_kzg: verify_data_column_sidecar_inclusion_proof(sidecar)
    q_verify_kzg --> q_send_chunk: verify_data_column_sidecar_kzg_proofs(sidecar)
    q_send_chunk --> q_check_limit: send response_chunk with DataColumnSidecar
    q_check_limit --> q_iter_columns: count < MAX_REQUEST_DATA_COLUMN_SIDECARS
    q_check_limit --> [*]: count >= MAX_REQUEST_DATA_COLUMN_SIDECARS / done
    q_iter_columns --> q_iter_slots: all columns for slot sent
    q_iter_slots --> [*]: all slots processed
    q_error --> [*]
